      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1925, Cotton Center was officially created as a consolidated school district, adding a school, cotton gins, and local businesses.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cotton_Center%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A post office opened in 1935, and that same year the first irrigation well was drilled to support growing farms.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
